  "body": "Located in one of Castor Bay's most prestigious streets, here is a wonderful opportunity to purchase a residence where the benefits of coastal living come to life.   \r\n\r\nRecent refurbishment including a new coloursteel roof, designer kitchen, exterior & interior painting adds a peace of mind for buyers to move in and enjoy.   \r\n\r\nWith solid brick construction, the home is set on two levels. On the main level there is an open plan layout which includes a lounge, dining area, kitchen and an indoor/outdoor flow to a deck area where you can relax and enjoy the views with family and friends. There are also two good size bedrooms plus a family bathroom with a separate toilet.   \r\n\r\nOn the lower level is another bedroom, bathroom and separate toilet. Also, a versatile rumpus area/second living area can be utilised as a fourth bedroom or home office.   \r\n\r\nGaraging is double with internal entry.   \r\n\r\nEnjoy the views of Rangitoto, the Hauraki Gulf and distant vistas of Auckland CBD.   \r\n\r\nThe home is perfectly positioned between the vibrant suburbs of Milford and Mairangi Bay where you can enjoy cafes, restaurants and local shops. The added bonus is the proximity to beaches, parks, Milford Marina and Pupuke Golf Course.   \r\n\r\nThe highly sought after school zones are Campbells Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools.   \r\n\r\nOur instructions are clear - don't miss out on this excellent opportunity to secure your next home!   \r\n\r\nJoin us at our open homes or call today for a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
